===============================================================================
ACOUSTIC & HARDWARE SAFETY ADDENDUM
===============================================================================
CritEQ is a system-wide parametric equalizer capable of applying significant
digital gain boosts (up to +24 dB per filter band, +24 dB preamp boost, and
150% master output scaling). Excessive digital gain, resonant filter peaks
(high Q / narrow bandwidth), or abrupt parameter changes can generate high
sound pressure levels (SPL) or digital clipping that may cause permanent
hearing damage or physical damage to headphones, studio monitors, and
amplification hardware.

Although CritEQ incorporates a built-in safety soft-clipper (`tanh`) in its
real-time audio processing pipeline, this software limiter cannot guarantee
protection against all hardware or acoustic overload conditions. By using
CritEQ, you acknowledge that you assume full responsibility for monitoring
output levels and protecting your hearing and audio equipment.
